trace.content:
[TEST] Perform formal neuropsychological assessment including:  
- Wechsler Intelligence Scale for Children–Fifth Edition (WISC-V) or Wechsler Adult Intelligence Scale–Fourth Edition (WAIS-IV), depending on age-appropriateness, with emphasis on verbal comprehension, perceptual reasoning, working memory, and processing speed indices;  
- Autism Diagnostic Observation Schedule, Second Edition (ADOS-2), Module 3 (for verbally fluent adolescents);  
- Vineland Adaptive Behavior Scales, Third Edition (Vineland-3), caregiver-report version.

